      "subject": "יעלה על לב",
      "rationale": "'A tɛna don dusukun na' — Heburukan fɔcogo tilelen: 'a tɛ ka dusukun kan'; Bamanankan ma a yɛrɛ ka daɲɛ ta."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "יפקדו",
      "rationale": "פקד fitini kɔrɔ caman: 'aw tɛna a ɲini' walima 'aw tɛna a ɲini ka ye' walima 'a tɛna a mara' — bayɛlɛmabagaw bɛ ntigɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "kelen ... fila",
      "rationale": "Jatew bɛ fɔ a bɛɛ: dugu kelen, faso fila — ni jate-dɔnni ye min bɛ Tsiyon ka segin-sɛnyɔrɔ jira."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "O kɔrɔ, ni aw bɛna bonya ani ka jiridenw bɔ dugukolo kɔnɔ, o donw na, Yawe ko, bɛɛ tɛna kɔ bɛɛ ko: Yawe ka layidu sanga; a tɛna don dusukun na, aw tɛna a lane, aw tɛna a ɲini, a tɛna dilan kokura.",
